title: "prerelation-js: the prerelation coefficient in JavaScript"
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free JavaScript implementation of the prerelation
  coefficient and its pairwise scan, with a browser calculator, held in
  parity with the Python reference implementation through committed
  golden vectors.
